    61→/*
    62→Worst cases being:
    63→
    64→Control characters (ASCII < 32)
    65→0x00 (1 byte) input => \u0000 output (6 bytes)
    66→1 * 6 => 6 (6 bytes required)
    67→
    68→or UTF-16 surrogate pairs
    69→4 bytes input in UTF-8 => \uXXXX\uYYYY (12 bytes).
    70→
    71→4 * 6 => 24 bytes (12 bytes required)
    72→
    73→The extra 2 bytes are for the quotes around the string
    74→
    75→*/
    76→#define RESERVE_STRING(_len) (2 + ((_len) * 6))
